-- SCP Tactical Panel -- Roblox Studio: LocalScript em StarterPlayerScripts local Players = game:GetService("Players") local LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer local PlayerGui = LocalPlayer:WaitForChild("PlayerGui") -- CONFIGURAÇÃO DAS EQUIPES local TEAM_CONFIG = { ["GUARD"] = { Color = Color3.fromRGB(100, 200, 255) }, ["MTF"] = { Color = Color3.fromRGB(40, 80, 180) }, ["SCP"] = { Color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 100, 190) } } -- ESTADO DO ESP local ESP_ENABLED = { ["GUARD"] = false, ["MTF"] = false, ["SCP"] = false } -- REMOVER PAINEL ANTIGO local oldGui = PlayerGui:FindFirstChild("SCPTacticalPanel") if oldGui then oldGui:Destroy() end -- INTERFACE local Gui = Instance.new("ScreenGui") Gui.Name = "SCPTacticalPanel" Gui.ResetOnSpawn = false Gui.Parent = PlayerGui local Panel = Instance.new("Frame") Panel.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(290, 260) Panel.Position = UDim2.new(0, 20, 0.3, 0) Panel.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(25, 25, 40) Panel.BorderSizePixel = 0 Panel.Parent = Gui local Corner = Instance.new("UICorner") Corner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, 12) Corner.Parent = Panel -- CABEÇALHO local Header = Instance.new("TextButton") Header.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 44) Header.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(65, 55, 130) Header.Text = "SCP TACTICAL PANEL [-]" Header.TextColor3 = Color3.new(1, 1, 1) Header.TextSize = 16 Header.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold Header.Parent = Panel local Minimized = false Header.Activated:Connect(function() Minimized = not Minimized for _, item in ipairs(Panel:GetChildren()) do if item ~= Header and item:IsA("GuiObject") then item.Visible = not Minimized end end Panel.Size = Minimized and UDim2.fromOffset(290, 44) or UDim2.fromOffset(290, 260) Header.Text = Minimized and "SCP TACTICAL PANEL [+]" or "SCP TACTICAL PANEL [-]" end) -- BOTÕES local function CreateButton(text, y, callback, color) local Button = Instance.new("TextButton") Button.Size = UDim2.new(1, -20, 0, 38) Button.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(10, y) Button.BackgroundColor3 = color or Color3.fromRGB(55, 55, 75) Button.TextColor3 = Color3.new(1, 1, 1) Button.TextSize = 14 Button.Font = Enum.Font.Gotham Button.Text = text Button.Parent = Panel local ButtonCorner = Instance.new("UICorner") ButtonCorner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, 8) ButtonCorner.Parent = Button Button.Activated:Connect(function() callback(Button) end) return Button end -- ESP DAS EQUIPES local function UpdateESP() for _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do if player ~= LocalPlayer then local character = player.Character if character then local highlight = character:FindFirstChild("SCPPanelHighlight") local teamName = player.Team and player.Team.Name local config = teamName and TEAM_CONFIG[teamName] if config and ESP_ENABLED[teamName] then if not highlight then highlight = Instance.new("Highlight") highlight.Name = "SCPPanelHighlight" highlight.Parent = character end highlight.FillColor = config.Color highlight.OutlineColor = config.Color highlight.FillTransparency = 0.5 highlight.OutlineTransparency = 0 highlight.Enabled = true elseif highlight then highlight:Destroy() end end end end end local function ToggleESP(teamName, button) ESP_ENABLED[teamName] = not ESP_ENABLED[teamName] button.Text = teamName .. ( ESP_ENABLED[teamName] and " — LIGADO" or " — DESLIGADO" ) UpdateESP() end CreateButton("ESP GUARD — DESLIGADO", 55, function(button) ToggleESP("GUARD", button) end, TEAM_CONFIG["GUARD"].Color) CreateButton("ESP MTF — DESLIGADO", 100, function(button) ToggleESP("MTF", button) end, TEAM_CONFIG["MTF"].Color) CreateButton("ESP SCP — DESLIGADO", 145, function(button) ToggleESP("SCP", button) end, TEAM_CONFIG["SCP"].Color) CreateButton("Atualizar destaques", 190, function() UpdateESP() end) -- ATUALIZAÇÃO DE PERSONAGENS E EQUIPES local function ConnectPlayer(player) player.CharacterAdded:Connect(function() task.wait(0.5) UpdateESP() end) player:GetPropertyChangedSignal("Team"):Connect(UpdateESP) end for _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do ConnectPlayer(player) end Players.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(player) ConnectPlayer(player) UpdateESP() end) Players.PlayerRemoving:Connect(UpdateESP) print("SCP Tactical Panel carregado!") 



